  "bio": "Discover the unique fusion of artistry at Urban Jungle Bali, nestled in the heart of Gianyar, Indonesia, where minimalist geometry meets eco-conscious ink. Our tranquil space offers a holistic experience, blending a vegan café ambiance with a tattoo studio renowned for its exquisite, vegan-friendly body art. Step into our creative oasis for a memorable tattoo and indulge in our selection of plant-based delights.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Gianyar, Indonesia"
